SCSCP -- SCSCP (Symbolic Computation Software Composability Protocol) support
*****************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides an SCSCP (see https://openmath.org/standard/scscp/ )
(Symbolic Computation Software Composability Protocol) server and client.

Author
======

  * Dan Roozemond (see http://magma.maths.usyd.edu.au/~danr )
    <dan.roozemond@gmail.com>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.2.1 of SCSCP, released March 16, 2011.

